---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/parallel-agents-resume-pass-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/parallel-agents-resume-pass-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Reading the resume moved 5 of 24 verdicts, 4 of them down"
  caption="One square for each candidate in a wave researched without resumes, then re-read when the resumes arrived."
>
  Unit chart of 24 candidates whose research ran on application text and public footprint, then was re-read against
  the resume. 19 verdicts held. 1 moved up, from verify-first to interview-grade. 4 moved down: two to verify-first
  and two to pass.
</Chart>
